        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Rockwood RM5670-1, Classic Brass Traditional Offset Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rockwood RM5670 Classic Offset Door Pull embodies timeless design and lasting craftsmanship, featuring refined details that enhance its traditional aesthetic. The offset design makes it an excellent choice for full-light residential doors or high-end storefront applications with narrow mounting stiles. Rockwood’s Classic Design Offset Pulls are available in three lengths, five finish options, and three mounting styles—thru-bolt, surface, or back-to-back—to suit a variety of installations.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Classic Brass Traditional Offset Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Brass</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b> RM5670-1-10:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<b> RM5670-1-20:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b> RM5670-1-30:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<b>Note</b>: This offset pull is handcrafted in the USA specifically for your order, offering customization options such as alternate lengths to suit your exact door requirements. Due to its made-to-order nature, this item is <b>non-cancelable and non-returnable</b>. For assistance or custom requests, </b> please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> prior to ordering.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Classic Brass Traditional Offset Pull",
                "description": "The Rockwood RM5670 Classic Offset Door Pull combines traditional styling with modern versatility. Designed for full-light residential and high-end storefront doors, it features an offset profile for narrow stiles and is available in three lengths, five finishes, and three mounting options to suit any application.",
